{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_001_04_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:48dbd521fece83d18c444d6f206fadfc7867c7058b8c48869107b7790d6ab22b",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:011cadf85564751c11cb244f7072e83d120eef2a16bc5cae05d50a49cf0256d1",
      "text": "（今后要继续靠偶像这份工作糊口的话，\n这种知名节目还是想出演一下的呢～）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_d:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57c4696bfff31aa2b67de98eb19ae453e4eb75108887238ffabb9b42a80e2f1d",
      "text": "（这正是打扫演艺界污垢的好机会啊）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_d:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d42b1443ce03c170deb0290f7039ba4772dbe6c3bdf36b671272cf705757f31",
      "text": "（如果在电视上介绍大海的魅力，\n说不定同好就会变多呢……！）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_d:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ccdb320b9587b296a9542e42805f8a36106ce03f299808e5576b5bcb04a34fb",
      "text": "想要通过试镜的壁垒虽然很高，\n但只要齐心协力一起努力吧！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_d:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:abd8205028a2d69ecee84732ff6df07792f36bcff25360141848addedcb35668",
      "text": "……正如克里斯先生所言，\n门槛好像挺高的呢～",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_d:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2660165df1b5154db397ac9f0e28c790fc904f23a2ac6fac75a480aec1a89a6b",
      "text": "那个，●●●●プロデューサー。这次的\n试镜，我们该做些什么才好呢～",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_d:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd27e0ea7b5734b6f22c1aa0cc5db54766fa71d1e8edcc9d140f022514cfccb1",
      "text": "展现出各位每个人所拥有的“自我风格”\n固然很重要，不过……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_d:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fdabf33d4193a5395eba7aacdaab9755a5c1c73a92fcb73db80d7a1b5b91d428",
      "text": "毕竟是刚结成不久的组合，让对方了解到\n“组合的魅力”也是非常重要的呢！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_d:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1dd4c7788b34bd3a21863344141c5b7831e59f2675ef67a005872e61baee7cca",
      "text": "考虑到节目的主旨，\n只要展现出雨彦的清扫技巧应该就没问题了吧。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_d:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8578d092915cbe638d5b345d909bd79b093a917591c23a5367571d35bca0d7ad",
      "text": "哈哈，要是那种事的话就交给我吧。\n要是能在现场演示打扫那就最好了。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_d:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:82c11d6a6ecd1271661737415cb8b5dee377bd8dfc1a845563df7a7969c4f405",
      "text": "（……组合的魅力吗～\n制作人也真会出难题呢～）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_d:cmd-000140:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d97839694a88d3dbaae2835aa42718463b83dd8670118274c73ca9eac5ddd44c",
      "text": "事务所",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_d:cmd-000152:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:528e2bf8a2e122da1c00778d5b9b71a8eb2cfed673fc0f52114a702953015faf",
      "text": "是●●●●プロデューサー吗？\n我是东云。现在方便耽误一点点时间吗？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_d:cmd-000154:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6aad4db1b126725eea08b3c31cb1a2ca80473a5a55d61bcbe85f8a061a6019a1",
      "text": "其实，我听说Legenders的各位要去参加\n《大扫除解决队》的试镜了……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_d:cmd-000156:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dbf7c64617b063519f93c78b5aa9679b733fd6d905c43aff92bc24be2d38e999",
      "text": "莫非是来加油助威的吗？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_d:cmd-000158:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53e7985015d319f44e228dcfdda2420ea4b036901c84d5dd9daf18cd6ea1ada2",
      "text": "是的，没错。……说起来，其实我\n经常会收看那个板块。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_d:cmd-000160:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0211a22aed66a3a8f484ee20bab334d7afbdbb95c7e55dd0f4aa72edb5905395",
      "text": "节目经常会播出一些\n对我们咖啡厅清扫很有帮助的信息哦。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_d:cmd-000162:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b3cd5410529ddf32bfcc4c81d44ac8eba99351208a7fbe71cc8056938b58b21",
      "text": "比如擦除顽固污渍的绝技，还有缩短打扫时间的\n诀窍等等，都非常有参考价值。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_d:cmd-000164:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b87bd2a807570eb7228685d13b802d2296cc168919851b75e8b01ea5fa17d3fa",
      "text": "就在刚才，我还在制作新款蛋糕。\n结果因为太集中于操作，厨房就……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_d:cmd-000166:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:088b2dbe831ff0f0a7119a8643e7e1dcbfae27b3ae696f0258806cdc4bb194ac",
      "text": "看来，正好可以试试之前节目里教过的\n新绝技了呢。呵呵。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_d:cmd-000168:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7189d321294be77e9263a2682e334d43ecf39b03af364512fc1e0608b92edc3",
      "text": "那么，我差不多该着手开始打扫了。\n请替我向大家转达一声加油。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_d:cmd-000170:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66ab07a9553f40bd33822cdcb0caa8a5fa50f47a06aceee2fa01bbc70e3c4e8a",
      "text": "也请转告他们，要是合格了我绝对会看节目的。\n……那么，我就先挂了。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    }
  }
}
